WEBVTT

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.370
Brother!

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.030
Sirius!

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.340
Toma! I never thought you would...

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:24.680
Did you think I could ever trust anyone reborn as a vile, wingless one?

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.820
Curse you!

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.020
Pretty good...

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.040
Genesis Gattai!

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.440
Go! Aquarion!

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:52.610
Apollo! Brother!

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:57.520
Is the light of Genesis healing my wounds?

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.520
He came back to life!

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.200
Sirius!

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.270
Are you...

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.600
Apollo... Reika...

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.740
You worried for me?

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.040
What're you talking about?!

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.870
That's right! We're friends!

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.280
Forgive me...

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:25.610
Welcome back, Solar Wing.

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.720
Curse you, Toma! Let's go!

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.050
--Right!
--Right!

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.490
--He's fast!
--Reika!

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:47.070
He's powerful!

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.840
He means business!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.470
Dammit!

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:53.140
This smell...

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.410
Chibiko!

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:58.400
You mean your friend?!

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.720
Apollo! Look after Chibi and the others!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.120
Chibiko!

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.020
He said "Chibiko"...

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.520
Apollo!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.190
Chibiko! Maji!

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.800
Giving up already?

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.870
What?!

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.900
Give back Chibiko and the others!

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.940
Apollo... use the power of my sword!

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:24.110
Sirius!

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.440
Thanks!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.950
You're making it interesting...

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.730
What?!

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.060
Child's play!

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.050
Lovely...

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:16.360
This truly is the light of my beloved Solar Wing!

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:20.020
The light of hope that will bring us back to power!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:25.170
Solar Wing has awakened...

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.040
Its pollen, possessed of qualities we lack,

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.040
has fertilized the Tree of Life...

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:37.380
New Angels- a new world- will be born...

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:40.380
We, too, must go to the Tree of Life...

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:47.920
Yes, to be absorbed by its roots to become new seedlings...

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.860
--To the Tree of Life!
--To the Tree of Life!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:55.960
To the Tree of Life!

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.570
What in heaven's name?!

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:19.050
Look! The Tree of Life is...

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.390
Look out!

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:47.750
<i>So lovely...</i>

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>At long last, the holy fruit will...</i>

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.730
<i>This can't be!</i>

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.720
<i>Solar Wing regained its true light!</i>

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:10.310
Didn't pollination occur with its true light?!

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:13.300
Don't die, oh Tree of Life!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.050
What?!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.880
You're finished!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.530
Toma!

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:58.720
Kill me if you wish.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:01.190
The world will come to an end, anyway.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.460
What do you mean?!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:09.660
The roots of the Tree of Life reach to the very core forces of this planet.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:14.100
If the tree dies, those forces will burst forth directly up onto the earth

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:18.110
and turn the land into a world without life.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.380
--What?!
--That's absurd!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.870
The Tree of Life is...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.090
Abnormal convective activity in the earth's mantle!

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:39.890
Distortion levels rising in every strata!

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.560
At this rate, there will be cataclysmic movements of the earth's crust!

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.330
What?!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:48.470
They must have felled the Tree of Life...

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.940
The world is coming to an end...

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.050
The world will end.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.150
What did you say?!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.280
Stop it! Killing him won't change anything!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.150
But he said the world is coming to an end!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.020
Still...

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.010
Take a good look!

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.560
Apollonius...

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.330
That smell...

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.530
A Shadow Angel...

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.200
The same smell as Toma!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.910
I get it...

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.940
Without a Shadow Angel aboard...

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.780
Without the power of a Shadow Angel,
Aquarion isn't complete!

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:31.850
What?!

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:36.220
Even with his wings torn off, the guy's still a Shadow Angel, right?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.550
What?

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.260
Of all things...

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:49.250
Our Angel wings were necessary for Solar Wing to truly awaken...

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.100
Reika!

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.350
Vector Luna's showing a teleport change reaction!

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.150
Who's trying to teleport?

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.480
It's... a Shadow Angel!

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.150
Why, you!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.960
Reika!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.560
Toma!

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:33.340
I'm not going to live much longer anyway...

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.310
You're not getting away!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.480
Come after me...

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.950
Gattai with me.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.750
I will become Solar Wing!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:50.630
Though my life might be swallowed by the Tree of Life...

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.460
I want to see the true awakening!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.000
Are you all right, Reika?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.730
Yes. And you?

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.330
Come back here!

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.240
Apollo?!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.270
I'm going, too!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.530
Silvia!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.040
Apollo!

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.110
Silvia?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.810
Don't go, Apollo!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.410
What're you saying?

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:15.020
The world might come to an end!

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:17.020
Then I'll go with you!

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.540
Please! Don't leave me behind!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.890
I can't. I want you to protect
Chibiko and the others!

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:30.970
I made a promise to Baron that
I'd rescue them without fail!

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:36.460
Apollo!

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.370
What?

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:42.640
Feel 12,000 years of spite!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:50.240
<i>Follow me, wingless ones...</i>

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:54.050
Here we go! Genesis Gattai!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.890
You're not getting your way!

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:01.890
You're not going to be the head!

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:12.170
Give me back Baron,
Chibiko and the others!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.180
Insolent wingless one!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:17.340
Learn how it feels to be betrayed!

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:24.220
All three Vector machines have transformed into heads.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:27.790
Third emotional aura turbulence growing!

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.390
At this rate, they'll self-destruct!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:33.330
Strata distortions peaking!

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:37.320
If they worsen at this pace, the world will... the world will...

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.100
Not now!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.710
Take that!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.040
Pierre!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.520
Are you okay, Silvia?

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:57.850
Pierre... I...

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:03.880
Silvia... that wing looks real good on you.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.120
Pierre...

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.500
Oh, no!

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.360
That's an... unmanned Vector!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.070
I'm coming!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.580
It's the Cherubim...

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.650
...it's back in action!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:32.090
Pierre!

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:33.420
Reika?!

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:36.360
Cursed Shadow Angel!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:39.760
I can't sit and watch any longer...

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.270
--Rena?!
--Rena?!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:46.900
You came to help?

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:51.070
It wasn't easy teleporting all this distance.

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:53.070
Let's quickly take care of business.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.640
Thanks, Rena. Let's do it, then!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:56.640
Nenshin!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:57.650
Gattai!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.710
Go! Aquarion!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.110
I feel on fire!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.090
I'm tingling all over!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:12.360
Aquarion Alpha!

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:14.350
<i>That woman again?</i>

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.360
That's nothing!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.360
Thank you, everyone...

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:32.010
Apollo... Brother...

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.150
Fire!

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.210
I'll kill them, or die trying!

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.990
Change! Walker!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:04.080
This is awful... they're all separate!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:07.080
Take a good look.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.780
Commander?

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:17.560
Take a good look at the pain Apollonius and Seliane caused 12,000 years ago.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.120
The hatred!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.030
And the depth of the darkness!

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:43.250
Forgive me...

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.920
At the time, on the day
I first met Apollonius,

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:53.530
I felt from the bottom of my heart that even if it tears me apart...

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:57.160
...even if the world came to an end...

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.170
I was...

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.870
...glad we met!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:21.490
When you clap your hands together, what exists in-between?

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:22.990
What?

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:27.330
Your right hand and left hand-
Angels and humans.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:31.670
Man and woman. Yin and Yang.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:34.430
What is between them?!

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.800
Commander?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:47.580
Feel the power of our Angel wings!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:48.420
Watch out!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.220
Reika, Pierre...

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:53.620
I'll use my power to fly inside her barrier field

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.620
Fly?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.450
Take care of the rest!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:14:59.830
What?

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.490
Did someone just teleport?!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.230
Now is the time to sever ourselves from...

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:06.330
"Misfortune"

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:07.670
...misfortune!

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:08.730
"Unlucky B-Reika"

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:23.340
Something that exists between my right and left hands?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:33.690
Between my right and left?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:40.970
Darkness?

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.430
Between both hands, there is... nothing...

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.210
Nothing, yet...

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.590
There's warmth...

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.300
A light born from darkness!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.570
Silvia?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.990
Brother...

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:36.320
My precious other me...

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.990
Me?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.000
Vile wingless one!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:49.370
What?!

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:52.670
I can never forgive you...

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.100
I can't forgive you, but...

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.650
So warm...

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:17.300
Apollo, do you remember...

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.000
...the day the world began?

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:25.540
Billions and billions of stars, billions and billions of galaxies...

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:29.640
...created in that holy moment from the void...

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:32.010
That miraculous moment...

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.410
Miraculous?

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:38.120
Yes. And the miracle of how...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:43.660
You and I met on this planet!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.390
Silvia!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.360
And now... we move forward on a new path!

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:07.310
I... only thought of rushing headlong by myself....

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:10.680
The pain and hatred I felt...

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:18.030
Was this the pain I inflicted on Toma 12,000 years ago?

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.660
I never understood the wingless ones...

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.670
Their pain, their joy.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:30.340
I never understood... the suffering the Angels endured as they died out...

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:33.670
The sadness of Mother Earth....

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.650
Shout it out! Genesis Gattai!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.620
--Genesis Gattai!
--Genesis Gattai!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.590
Genesis Gattai?

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.580
The three of them?

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:52.260
Beasts... the beasts...

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.920
...are one!

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.730
Genesis Gattai!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.220
Go!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:02.090
Aquarion!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.380
I've never felt my heart pound like this!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.590
A new essence...

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.820
We are...

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:25.120
...alive!

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.930
Solar Aquarion Gattai complete!

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.700
Aura power increasing.
It's off the charts!

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:40.900
I wouldn't have believed it...
Angels and humans as one...

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:49.810
Incredible!

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.990
Solar Wing!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:04.830
Apollo!

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.330
Thank you, Silvia!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.670
What?

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:17.840
Your familiar fragrance...
I'll never forget it!

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:18.470
Apol-

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:39.300
Apollo?

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:44.140
If all goes well, let's meet again in another 12,000 years!

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.570
Apollo!

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.150
Let's go, Friends.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:53.180
For the sake of humans and Angels...

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.550
And this planet...

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:57.250
--A new Genesis!
--A new Genesis!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:00.690
"We Are the Universe"

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:01.480
"Infinite Gattai Punch"

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:18.400
Chibiko!

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.530
Thank goodness!

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:22.470
Chibiko...

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:25.070
Silvia?

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:27.570
How do know who I am?

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:32.570
Apollo told me in a dream.

00:22:34.050 --> 00:22:36.220
In your dream?

00:22:36.220 --> 00:22:38.490
Silvia...

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:41.680
Where's Apollo? Where did he go?

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:45.690
Apollo will...

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:49.030
be back for sure...

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:53.020
One day, to this planet.

00:23:40.450 --> 00:23:42.420
"The Day the World Begins" "I Hope to be Continued"

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:51.190
<i>On the first day of the world,</i> <i>under the Tree of Life,</i>

00:23:51.190 --> 00:23:57.530
<i>the two of us heard the voices of whales,</i> <i>reverberating from afar.</i>

00:23:57.530 --> 00:24:03.870
<i>With all that we have lost,</i> <i>and all that we have loved</i>

00:24:03.870 --> 00:24:10.540
<i>embraced in our arms,</i> <i>where will we wander off to now?</i>

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:16.880
<i>The answer lies in the amber sun.</i>

00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:23.220
<i>If I had never met you,</i>
<i>I would have been a destroying angel.</i>

00:24:23.220 --> 00:24:28.830
<i>My soul possessed of</i> <i>a twinkling of immortality,</i>

00:24:28.830 --> 00:24:32.500
<i>do not wound my wings.</i>

00:24:32.500 --> 00:24:39.170
<i>I was born to know this feeling.</i>

00:24:39.170 --> 00:24:45.510
<i>For ten thousand years</i> <i>and two thousand more, I've loved you.</i>

00:24:45.510 --> 00:24:51.850
<i>After eight thousand years,</i>
<i>I loved you even more.</i>

00:24:51.850 --> 00:24:58.190
<i>For another hundred million years</i> <i>and two thousand more, I'll still love you.</i>

00:24:58.190 --> 00:25:06.730
<i>From the first day I knew you,</i> <i>the music in my hell has never stopped.</i>
